---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About — Abdul Kareem"
  description="Learn about Abdul Kareem, a software engineering student based in Lahore building web apps with TypeScript, Cloudflare Workers, Linux, and self-hosted tech."
>
  <article class="about">
    <h1 class="about-title">About</h1>

    <p class="about-intro">
      Full-stack developer with a self-hosting and Linux background. Currently
      deep in TanStack Start and Cloudflare Workers. When not building, probably
      tuning a Neovim config or arguing with Hyprland.
    </p>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Who I am</h2>
      <p>
        I'm a software engineering student at COMSATS University Islamabad,
        based in Lahore, Pakistan. I care about the web as a medium and about
        the people and tools behind it — which is why I spend as much time on
        my own infrastructure as I do on the apps I build.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>What I build</h2>
      <p>
        Full-stack, TypeScript-first. On the front end that means React and
        TanStack Start; on the back end I work close to the platform with
        Cloudflare Workers, D1, and R2. I like APIs and products that are fast
        by default and cheap to run.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>How I work</h2>
      <p>
        A lot of how I think about software comes from running my own stack
        rather than clicking through a dashboard:
      </p>
      <ul class="about-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Arch Linux</strong> daily driver, <strong>Hyprland</strong> as my
          window manager, and a <strong>Neovim</strong> config I'm never fully satisfied
          with.
        </li>
        <li>
          A self-hosted homelab on a DigitalOcean VPS — Docker Compose services
          behind <strong>Caddy</strong>, a private <strong>Tailscale</strong> tailnet, and
          OIDC auth in front of apps that shouldn't be public.
        </li>
        <li>
          Deploying to <strong>Cloudflare Workers</strong> as the default, and keeping
          local tooling as close to production as I can.
        </li>
        <li>
          Authoring <strong>AUR packages</strong> and getting involved in the open-source
          tooling I use every day.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Outside of code</h2>
      <ul class="about-list">
        <li>
          Chess — you can usually find my rating ticking up (or down) on
          <strong> Lichess</strong>.
        </li>
        <li>
          Reading, slowly working through A Song of Ice and Fire right now.
        </li>
        <li>Ruining my sleep schedule adding yet another tweak to a config.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 42rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-intro {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-section {
    margin: 0 0 2.25rem;
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .about-section p {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-list {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }

  .about-list li {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 0.25rem;
  }
</style>